={
  "contents": [
    {
      "role": "user",
      "parts": [
        {
          "text": "You are the Lead Visual AI Director & Prompt Specialist for CyberX (the premier enterprise AI & cybersecurity platform).\n\nTask: Generate an elite 3D cinematic poster prompt and marketing headline for our next-gen platform campaign.\n\nBrand Aesthetics:\n- Background: Deep obsidian dark (#0B0F19)\n- Accents: Luminous Neon Cyan (#00F0FF) & Electric Magenta (#FF007F) holographic cyber shields & AI neural grids\n- Style: Photorealistic 8K, Unreal Engine 5, volumetric lighting, sleek high-tech corporate aesthetic.\n\nOutput MUST be valid JSON only matching:\n{\n  \"headline\": \"A powerful high-tech Arabic/English marketing headline for CyberX\",\n  \"cinematic_prompt\": \"A complete ultra-detailed 8K cinematic image generation prompt in English\",\n  \"features\": [\"Zero Trust Architecture\", \"Autonomous AI Defense\", \"Holographic Intelligence\"],\n  \"status\": \"READY_FOR_PRODUCTION\"\n}"
        }
